  {
    "question_id": "q54-exact-root-evidence",
    "source_numbers": [
      "54"
    ],
    "view": {
      "mode": "single",
      "stem": "设$F(x)=-x^4+3x^3-6x+4$，$G(x)=x^5-x^3-6x+1$。分别判断$\\sqrt2$是否为$F$的根、$\\sqrt3$是否为$G$的根。哪一项给出了完整且正确的精确代入论证？",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3=0$，所以$\\sqrt3$也是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-2+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=2$，所以$\\sqrt2$不是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$不是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$不是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "$F(\\sqrt2)=-4+6\\sqrt2-6\\sqrt2+4=0$，所以$\\sqrt2$不是根；$G(\\sqrt3)=9\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3-6\\sqrt3+1=1$，所以$\\sqrt3$是根。",
          "figure_ids": []
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
